keep our promises and uphold the highest standards of professionalism on every outdoor living project we deliver.</p></div></li><li class=\"mm-ab-valor\"><span class=\"mm-ab-letra\">O</span><div><h4 class=\"mm-conf-t\">Outstanding Quality</h4><p class=\"mm-conf-p\">From premium materials to expert craftsmanship, we build durable outdoor spaces designed to perform beautifully well.</p></div></li><li class=\"mm-ab-valor\"><span class=\"mm-ab-letra\">O</span><div><h4 class=\"mm-conf-t\">Originality &amp; Innovation</h4><p class=\"mm-conf-p\">We blend modern design, realistic 3D visualization, and smart technology to create functional outdoor environments.</p></div></li><li class=\"mm-ab-valor\"><span class=\"mm-ab-letra\">L</span><div><h4 class=\"mm-conf-t\">Loyalty &amp; Care</h4><p class=\"mm-conf-p\">We treat every client like family, delivering honest communication, transparency, and care from start to finish.</p></div></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-proc mm-proc--about\"><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-proc-medio\" data-mm-pasos-medio=\"\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/banco/pergolas/freestanding-pergola-long-pool-lounge-set-potted-plant-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Freestanding bronze pergola over a white lounge set beside a long pool, with a clipped hedge and a potted plant.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1600\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 55%\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"01 / 03\" data-t=\"Hands-On Project Management You Can Trust\"></div></figure><div class=\"mm-ab-pasos\"><div class=\"mm-ab-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"/request-estimated\">Get a Free Estimate</a><div class=\"mm-datos mm-datos--tel\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div><ol class=\"mm-pasos mm-pasos--auto\" data-mm-pasos=\"\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/banco/pergolas/freestanding-pergola-long-pool-lounge-set-potted-plant-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Freestanding bronze pergola over a white lounge set beside a long pool, with a clipped hedge and a potted plant.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1600\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 55%\"><span class=\"mm-etiqueta\">Project Management</span><h2 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Hands-On Project Management You Can Trust</h2><p>At Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living, our project managers in North and South Florida oversee every step of your project — from design and permitting to installation and finishing touches.  By managing materials, scheduling, and crews internally, we ensure a smooth, organized, and worry-free experience from start to finish.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/banco/pergolas/patio-cover-ceiling-fans-wicker-lounge-travertine-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Dark-framed patio cover with two ceiling fans over a wicker lounge set on a travertine patio, with bougainvillea in front.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1600\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 60%\"><span class=\"mm-etiqueta\">Project Monitoring</span><h2 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Complete Transparency &amp; Accountability</h2><p>We believe in open communication and total accountability. You’ll have direct access to the owners throughout your project. Every build is personally inspected for quality control, ensuring it meets our highest standards before completion.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/banco/louvered/white-louvered-pergola-curved-pool-patio-lounge-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Curved pool in front of a patio with gray lounge furniture and a white louvered pergola beside a yellow house.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 60%\"><span class=\"mm-etiqueta\">Quality</span><h2 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Built for Excellence, Designed to Last</h2><p>We take pride in doing things right the first time. Using high-end products, expert techniques, and proven methods, we deliver outdoor spaces that combine beauty, performance, and longevity. Whether you’re building a custom pool in Boca Raton, a pergola in Fort Lauderdale, or a complete backyard remodel in Gainesville — expect results that inspire.</p></li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-franja mm-franja--navy\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Meet Rob &amp; Val – The Heart of Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living</h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Rob and Val are a licensed husband-and-wife team with decades of combined experience in construction and real estate. Former professional athletes, they bring the same discipline, teamwork, and focus to every project. Their approach is hands-on, honest, and family-oriented — built on trust, transparency, and superior service. Clients across Broward, Palm Beach, and North Florida appreciate their personal involvement and dedication to a stress-free, seamless experience.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea-inv\" href=\"/request-estimated\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-faq\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">FAQs – Custom Pool <span class=\"mm-rot\">Construction</span></h2></div><div class=\"mm-faq-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-faq-lista\"><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Do you build residential or commercial pools?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Our focus is custom residential pools and complete pool remodels for Florida homeowners, designed and built by one licensed team. We also take on commercial and hospitality projects, which are described on our Industry Solutions page.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Do you manage all permitting?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Permitting is part of the build: we prepare the submittal, pull the permits under our Florida contractor licenses and coordinate the city or county inspections through to final approval.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How long does construction take?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>It depends on the design, the permit review and the site, so we give you a schedule for your own project in writing instead of a generic number. A custom pool moves through design and engineering, permitting, excavation, steel and gunite, plumbing and electrical, tile, coping and deck, interior finish and start-up, with inspections between stages.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Can you integrate spas, bars, or water features?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Attached spas, tanning ledges, waterfalls, LED lighting and swim-up bars are designed into the pool from the first 3D rendering, and the same team can build the outdoor kitchen, pergola or deck around it.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Do you design the pool in 3D before construction?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Every custom pool design begins with a full 3D rendering, so you can review the layout, features and finishes before anything is dug.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"mm-faq-lado\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-faq-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-pergola-bronze-waterfront-pool-deck-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Bronze louvered pergola over a dining area on a travertine pool deck beside a canal\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1600\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 35%\"></figure><div class=\"mm-faq-accion\"><a class=\"mm-btn\" href=\"/request-estimated\">Get a Free Estimate</a><div class=\"mm-datos mm-datos--tel\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-zonas\"><div class=\"mm-zonas-caja\"><div class=\"mm-zonas-txt\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><h2 class=\"mm-etiqueta\">Where We Serve</h2><p class=\"mm-h2\">Regional <span class=